### HTTP 接口（uvicorn serve:app，127.0.0.1:8099）
GET /health
{"ok":true,"server":"5.7.25-OceanBase seekdb-v1.4.0.0","user":"minimax_ctx@%","specs":9}

GET /tasks/task-arr-element-dml/history
[{"revision":1,"reason":"save after after"},{"revision":2,"reason":"save after after"},{"revision":3,"reason":"after code apply"},{"revision":4,"reason":"save after after"}]

GET /specs 前两项
[{"id":"ARR-001","kind":"must-change","state":"done",...},{"id":"ARR-002","kind":"must-change","state":"open",...}]

说明：HTTP 接口与 run.py 共用 context/operations.py 与 context/powercontext.py，
所有读取都直接查 seekdb，没有进程内缓存。
